v 3
d surardl: Seemingly unrelated ARDL cointegration and bounds testing
d
d  surardl estimates the seemingly unrelated autoregressive distributed lag
d  (SUR-ARDL) model of Arif & Furuoka (2026), which embeds the Pesaran, Shin &
d  Smith (2001) conditional error-correction specification in a Zellner (1962)
d  SUR system and estimates it by feasible GLS. It reports the SUR bounds test
d  for a long-run level relationship with tabulated (PSS 2001, Narayan 2005),
d  simulated and residual-bootstrap critical values, long-run coefficients with
d  delta-method, Fieller and bootstrap intervals, and cross-equation Wald tests
d  for poolability and for equality of adjustment speeds and long-run
d  coefficients. Journal-quality tables and figures are produced throughout.
d
d Version: 1.0.1
d Requires: Stata version 14.0
d Distribution-Date: 20261010
d Author: Merwan Roudane
d Support: email merwanroudane920@gmail.com
d
